## 3. Prohibited Use

Without prior written permission from the copyright holder, you may not:

### Deployment

* Deploy, host, operate, or run this software as a publicly or privately accessible service, application, website, API, or product.
* Use this software in a production environment.

### Commercial Use

* Use this software or any substantial portion of it for commercial purposes.
* Sell, license, monetize, or provide products or services substantially based on this software.

### Redistribution

* Redistribute, republish, sublicense, sell, or otherwise provide copies of the source code or substantial portions of it.
* Repackage this software as another project, product, template, library, application, or service.

### Derivative Products

* Create and distribute substantially derivative products based on this software.
* Copy substantial portions of the implementation into another publicly distributed or commercial project.

### Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning

You may not use this repository, its source code, documentation, assets, or other contents:

* to train an artificial intelligence or machine learning model;
* to fine-tune, retrain, adapt, or improve a model;
* to create or contribute to an AI/ML training dataset;
* for model distillation or synthetic training-data generation;
* for automated model evaluation or benchmarking datasets;
* to generate embeddings for the purpose of building a reusable AI knowledge base;
* for retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) datasets or systems;
* for code-generation training, code-completion training, or similar machine-learning purposes.

Automated collection of this repository for any of the purposes above is expressly prohibited.

